{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Approach and take object, check its properties and perform specific task, otherwise scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = CheckProperties    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectReached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    />\"",
